  ── Distribution Shape ──────────────────────
  Why: Skewness and kurtosis indicate departures from a normal (bell-shaped) distribution.
  Skewness            1.2338		Substantial right skew (|skew| < 2 is typically acceptable)
  Kurtosis (excess)   1.6355		Near-normal peakedness (0 = normal; |excess| < 7 treated as typical)
